
@startuml
title BMS Charging Management

start

:Receive charging request from VCU/OBC;
:Acquire battery measurements;
:Calculate SoC and SoP;
:Check voltage and temperature limits;

if (Battery conditions valid?) then (Yes)

  :Calculate maximum charging current;
  :Calculate maximum charging voltage;
  :Transmit charging limits to OBC;
  :Monitor charging process;

  if (Charging limit exceeded?) then (Yes)
    :Reduce charging limit or stop charging;
    :Report fault if required;
  else (No)
    :Continue charging;
  endif

else (No)
  :Reject or inhibit charging;
  :Report diagnostic fault;
endif

stop
@enduml
